    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Adobe is a publicly traded software company founded in 1982 and headquartered in San Jose, CA. Its website, specifically the Adobe Express section, describes the product as an all-in-one design, photo, and video tool intended to make content creation easy, with capabilities spanning social content, videos, and logos. The site also highlights an AI Assistant that allows users to prompt, create, and edit content while preserving existing elements.\n\nAdobe offers several AI-oriented products tracked by this site. Adobe Express AI is a lightweight design tool with integration of Adobe Firefly, Adobe's image generation model, both of which the company describes as trained on commercially safe data. Premiere Pro AI extends those capabilities into professional video editing, including generative extend and color match features, while Adobe Podcast AI focuses on audio enhancement and speech processing, also carrying the company's commercial-safe training claim.\n\nAccording to SEC filings, Adobe reported revenue of approximately $23,769,000,000 for the period ending November 28, 2025, filed as a 10-K. The company trades on public markets under the ticker ADBE and holds SEC CIK 0000796343. No litigation or MCP server registrations are recorded in the held facts for this entry.",
